[00:10.26]This room could be haunted, a vision to the blind
[00:16.50]Wishing sleep held me in her arms forever
[00:23.29]Shadows dance around, perfectly blurring up the lines
[00:30.16]Hallucinations start to intertwine
[00:35.28]I open my eyes
[00:41.77]Her face lingers on the walls
[00:49.12]She's stuck on rewind in my mind
[00:56.72]I try to move on, but the past won't leave my bed
[01:05.47]I hear it all the time like the wind between the chimes
[01:11.56]Holding on to what we had together
[01:18.25]A single note of my prsistent hopeless lullabis
[01:25.06]I know that I can't sleep forever
[01:30.41]I open my eyes
[01:37.46]Her face lingers on the walls
[01:44.18]She's stuck on rewind in my mind
[01:51.56]I try to move on, but the past won't leave my, my bed
